#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:2
msgid "Environment inventory"
msgstr "环境变量清单"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:4
msgid ""
"Use this inventory to find a configuration value, see which component "
"reads it, and learn where to set it. When application defaults differ "
"from the supported Compose deployment, both are listed."
msgstr "这份清单用来查某个配置项：它由哪个组件读取、应该在哪里设置。应用自身的默认值和官方 Compose 部署里的值不一样时，两个都会列出来。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:8
msgid ""
"For local setup, start with the [developer "
"guide](docs/developer/development.md). For a deployment, start with the "
"[control-plane configuration](deploy/control-plane/.env.example) and "
"[host configuration](deploy/host/.env.example). The [release "
"contract](deploy/release/README.md) describes packaged artifacts. Names "
"inherited from HybridInference remain in use."
msgstr ""
"在本地搭环境，先看[开发者指南](docs/developer/development.md)。要部署，先看[控制平面配置](deploy"
"/control-"
"plane/.env.example)和[主机配置](deploy/host/.env.example)。打包产物的说明见[发布契约](deploy/release/README.md)。从"
" HybridInference 沿用下来的名字仍在使用。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:15
msgid "**Keep deployment values outside this public repository.**"
msgstr "**部署用的具体值不要放进这个公开仓库。**"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:17
msgid ""
"Store secrets in the operator's private environment/unit files or read-"
"only key mounts. Keep actual identifiers, hostnames, port allocations, "
"tunnel topology and app registrations in the private deployment overlay. "
"Public examples use placeholders such as `agents.example.org`; documented"
" protocol ports and defaults are safe to retain here."
msgstr ""
"secret 放在运维人员私有的环境文件、systemd unit "
"文件，或只读挂载的密钥文件里。真实的标识、主机名、端口分配、隧道拓扑和应用注册信息，放在私有的部署 overlay 里。公开的示例都用 "
"`agents.example.org` 这样的占位符；文档里写到的协议端口和默认值，留在这里是安全的。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:23
msgid "Settings and bootstrap configuration"
msgstr "设置与初始化配置"

